{"task_id": "Mbpp/103", "solution": "import math\ndef eulerian_num(n: int, m: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the Eulerian number a(n, m).\n    This number represents the count of permutations of {1, ..., n} with exactly m ascents.\n    \"\"\"\n    # The Eulerian number a(n, m) is given by the formula:\n    # a(n, m) = sum_{j=0}^{m} (-1)^j * C(n + 1, j) * (m + 1 - j)^n\n    total = 0\n    for j in range(m + 1):\n        # Calculate the binomial coefficient C(n + 1, j)\n        combinations = math.comb(n + 1, j)\n        \n        # Calculate the power term (m + 1 - j)^n\n        power_term = (m + 1 - j)**n\n        \n        # Determine the sign based on j\n        sign = (-1)**j\n        \n        total += sign * combinations * power_term\n        \n    return total"}
