{"task_id": "Mbpp/137", "solution": "def zero_count(arr: list[int]) -> float:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the ratio of zero elements to non-zero elements in an array.\n\n    Returns 0.0 if there are no non-zero elements.\n    \"\"\"\n    zero_count_val = 0\n    non_zero_count_val = 0\n    for x in arr:\n        if x == 0:\n            zero_count_val += 1\n        else:\n            non_zero_count_val += 1\n\n    if non_zero_count_val == 0:\n        return 0.0\n    else:\n        return float(zero_count_val) / non_zero_count_val"}
