{"task_id": "Mbpp/267", "solution": "def square_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of the squares of the first n odd natural numbers.\n    For example, square_Sum(2) returns 10 (1^2 + 3^2 = 10).\n    \"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    for i in range(n):\n        odd_number = 2 * i + 1\n        total_sum += odd_number ** 2\n    return total_sum"}
