{"task_id": "Mbpp/280", "solution": "def sequential_search(array: list, element: any) -> tuple[bool, int]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Searches for an element in an array using a sequential scan.\n\n    Args:\n        array (list): The list of elements to search through.\n        element (any): The target element to find.\n\n    Returns:\n        tuple[bool, int]: A tuple where the first element is True if the\n                          element is found, False otherwise. The second\n                          element is the zero-based index of the first\n                          occurrence if found, or -1 if not found.\n    \"\"\"\n    for i, item in enumerate(array):\n        if item == element:\n            return (True, i)\n    return (False, -1)"}
