{"task_id": "Mbpp/409", "solution": "class Tuple:\n    \"\"\"Encapsulates two numerical values and calculates their product.\"\"\"\n    def __init__(self, value1, value2):\n        self.value1 = value1\n        self.value2 = value2\n\n    def calculate_product(self):\n        \"\"\"Returns the product of value1 and value2.\"\"\"\n        return self.value1 * self.value2\ndef min_product_tuple(list_of_tuples):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the minimum product from the pairs of tuples within a given list.\n    Assumes valid input structure and types, as per constraints.\n    \"\"\"\n    _validate_input_list(list_of_tuples)\n\n    products = []\n    for item_tuple in list_of_tuples:\n        t_obj = Tuple(item_tuple[0], item_tuple[1])\n        products.append(t_obj.calculate_product())\n\n    return min(products)"}
