{"task_id": "Mbpp/626", "solution": "from typing import Optional\ndef triangle_area(radius: float) -> Optional[float]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the area of the largest triangle that can be inscribed in a semicircle\n    with the given radius.\n    \"\"\"\n    if radius < 0:\n        return None\n\n    base = 2 * radius\n    height = radius\n\n    area = 0.5 * base * height\n\n    return area"}
