{"task_id": "Mbpp/638", "solution": "import math\ndef wind_chill(wind_velocity_kmh, temperature_celsius):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the wind chill index using the specified formula and rounds to the nearest integer.\n    The formula is WC = 13.12 + 0.6215T - 11.37V^0.16 + 0.3965T V^0.16.\n    \"\"\"\n    V = wind_velocity_kmh\n    T = temperature_celsius\n\n    # Apply formula: WC = 13.12 + 0.6215T - 11.37V^0.16 + 0.3965T V^0.16\n    V_pow_0_16 = math.pow(V, 0.16) if V > 0 else 0.0\n    \n    raw_wc = 13.12 + (0.6215 * T) - (11.37 * V_pow_0_16) + (0.3965 * T * V_pow_0_16)\n\n    # Round to the nearest integer\n    rounded_wc = round(raw_wc)\n\n    return int(rounded_wc)"}
