{"task_id": "Mbpp/731", "solution": "import math\ndef lateralsurface_cone(radius: float, height: float) -> float:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the lateral surface area of a cone.\n\n    Args:\n        radius: The radius of the cone's base.\n        height: The height of the cone.\n    \"\"\"\n    slant_height = math.sqrt(radius**2 + height**2)\n    lateral_surface_area = math.pi * radius * slant_height\n    return lateral_surface_area"}
