{"task_id": "Mbpp/799", "solution": "def left_rotate(number: int, d: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Performs a left bit rotation on a 32-bit integer.\"\"\"\n    INT_BITS = 32\n    MASK = (1 << INT_BITS) - 1\n\n    number &= MASK\n    effective_d = d % INT_BITS\n\n    rotated_number = ((number << effective_d) | (number >> (INT_BITS - effective_d))) & MASK\n    return rotated_number"}
