{"task_id": "Mbpp/108", "solution": "def merge_sorted_list(list1: list, list2: list, list3: list) -> list:\n    \"\"\"\n    Merges three lists into a single sorted list.\n    Combines all elements and sorts them in ascending order.\n    \"\"\"\n    merged_list = list1 + list2 + list3\n    merged_list.sort()\n    return merged_list"}
